Your passion for singing the praises of the Sun reaches its zenith.

Your Chanting now increases your light and fire damage by [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; SP 100)] and, up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] times per turn when you are hit by a weapon attack, you will gain [2.0, 3.0, 3.8, 4.4, 5.0 (TL1-5)] Positive Energy.

These values scale with your Spellpower.
